[{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1216:b004:l021","ordinal":168961,"en":"Let us depart safely for our lands."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1216:b004:l022","ordinal":168962,"en":"Your infidels are a grim people;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1216:b004:l023","ordinal":168963,"en":"If by chance they come by tens of thousands,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1216:b004:l024","ordinal":168964,"en":"They will plunder everything."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1216:b004:l025","ordinal":168965,"en":"These infidels will not take only the prize;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1216:b004:l026","ordinal":168966,"en":"They seem able to take"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1216:b004:l027","ordinal":168967,"en":"Every one of us completely."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1216:b004:l028","ordinal":168968,"en":"Let us submit to the words"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1216:b004:l029","ordinal":168969,"en":"Of Chinese as numerous as ants."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1216:b004:l030","ordinal":168970,"en":"Akkula's prize—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1216:b004:l031","ordinal":168971,"en":"Noble Manas, if you heed us,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1216:b004:l032","ordinal":168972,"en":"Let us give it as an offering."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1216:b004:l033","ordinal":168973,"en":"Since we invited them with honor to the feast,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1216:b004:l034","ordinal":168974,"en":"The shameless, foolish kinsmen"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1216:b004:l035","ordinal":168975,"en":"Have loaded troops upon camels"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1216:b004:l036","ordinal":168976,"en":"To fight your Chinese;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1216:b004:l037","ordinal":168977,"en":"They loaded bullets upon Bil,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1216:b004:l038","ordinal":168978,"en":"And from the Kangly people"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1216:b004:l039","ordinal":168979,"en":"Have taken countless tens of thousands of troops."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b003:l001","ordinal":168980,"en":"Their fortress stands on the slope;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b003:l002","ordinal":168981,"en":"The infidel people are numerous."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b003:l003","ordinal":168982,"en":"Their grass above has grown thick;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b003:l004","ordinal":168983,"en":"The Muslim people are few."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b003:l005","ordinal":168984,"en":"Accomplished Manas, heed us!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b003:l006","ordinal":168985,"en":"Will seven wolves fighting over one foal"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b003:l007","ordinal":168986,"en":"Leave even its carrion?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b003:l008","ordinal":168987,"en":"They are a people of seven ages;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b003:l009","ordinal":168988,"en":"If they strike the palm-sized Muslims,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b003:l010","ordinal":168989,"en":"Will they leave even our carrion?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b003:l011","ordinal":168990,"en":"Their root is a black lake;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b003:l012","ordinal":168991,"en":"They are the inexhaustible Chinese people."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b003:l013","ordinal":168992,"en":"Can any man match them?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b003:l014","ordinal":168993,"en":"If these infidels surge like a flood,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b003:l015","ordinal":168994,"en":"Will they spare a soul?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b003:l016","ordinal":168995,"en":"Can one who clashes with the black, monstrous Chinese survive?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b003:l017","ordinal":168996,"en":"Can one who grapples them remain alive?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b003:l018","ordinal":168997,"en":"With the dog whose mother is forsworn,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b003:l019","ordinal":168998,"en":"Let us not enter into enmity."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b003:l020","ordinal":168999,"en":"Let us not invite it upon ourselves;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b003:l021","ordinal":169000,"en":"Let us not bring calamity"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b003:l022","ordinal":169001,"en":"Upon our dear heads."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b003:l023","ordinal":169002,"en":"Let us not see slaughter from China"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b003:l024","ordinal":169003,"en":"And all die together!”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b003:l025","ordinal":169004,"en":"When the Muslims said this,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b003:l026","ordinal":169005,"en":"Hero Manas surged in wrath."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b003:l027","ordinal":169006,"en":"Raging then,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b003:l028","ordinal":169007,"en":"He confined some,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b003:l029","ordinal":169008,"en":"And beat others."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b003:l030","ordinal":169009,"en":"Leaning toward every valley,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b003:l031","ordinal":169010,"en":"Their migration remained behind—did you see?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b003:l032","ordinal":169011,"en":"Saying, “They have acted thus"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b003:l033","ordinal":169012,"en":"Toward noble Prince Manas,”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b003:l034","ordinal":169013,"en":"The palm-sized Muslims"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b003:l035","ordinal":169014,"en":"Themselves remained—did you see?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b003:l036","ordinal":169015,"en":"“Will we not all reach the root together?!”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b003:l037","ordinal":169016,"en":"The Muslims murmured;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b003:l038","ordinal":169017,"en":"Before China could destroy them,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b003:l039","ordinal":169018,"en":"Manas himself would slaughter"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b005:l001","ordinal":169019,"en":"The palm-sized people of Islam."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b005:l002","ordinal":169020,"en":"The accursed bloodthirsty man's"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b005:l003","ordinal":169021,"en":"Command lived in his words,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b005:l004","ordinal":169022,"en":"And stubbornness lived in his eyes."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b005:l005","ordinal":169023,"en":"This accursed bloodthirsty man,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b005:l006","ordinal":169024,"en":"Quarreling with China,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b005:l007","ordinal":169025,"en":"Speaks many such words;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b005:l008","ordinal":169026,"en":"If you live, wait and see—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b005:l009","ordinal":169027,"en":"The palm-sized Muslims,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b005:l010","ordinal":169028,"en":"He will destroy them himself."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b005:l011","ordinal":169029,"en":"Will he heed the words of the weak?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b005:l012","ordinal":169030,"en":"Will a river-flood engulf us,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b005:l013","ordinal":169031,"en":"And many souls die?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b005:l014","ordinal":169032,"en":"It is a surging flood;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b005:l015","ordinal":169033,"en":"The Chinese people are mountain-like."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b005:l016","ordinal":169034,"en":"If a mountain falls, will it spare us?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b005:l017","ordinal":169035,"en":"Can one who attacks"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b005:l018","ordinal":169036,"en":"The teeming infidels survive?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b005:l019","ordinal":169037,"en":"If you suddenly grapple them,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b005:l020","ordinal":169038,"en":"If we suddenly attack,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b005:l021","ordinal":169039,"en":"Will they not bring calamity?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b005:l022","ordinal":169040,"en":"Will we not all reach our root together?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b005:l023","ordinal":169041,"en":"If we match strength with the infidels,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b005:l024","ordinal":169042,"en":"Will they not bind alive"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b005:l025","ordinal":169043,"en":"Every one of the whole people?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b005:l026","ordinal":169044,"en":"From Jylgynduu, Keng-Kol, and Talas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b005:l027","ordinal":169045,"en":"We are fated to suffer humiliation"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b005:l028","ordinal":169046,"en":"Because of ill-starred Manas."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b005:l029","ordinal":169047,"en":"This is his hardened habit;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b005:l030","ordinal":169048,"en":"Your grim bloodthirsty man"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b005:l031","ordinal":169049,"en":"Would drive everyone into China—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b005:l032","ordinal":169050,"en":"Such is his way of bringing slaughter."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b005:l033","ordinal":169051,"en":"May the incorrigible wretch never prosper;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b005:l034","ordinal":169052,"en":"He remains bellowing."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b005:l035","ordinal":169053,"en":"If we merely watch, upon the whole age"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b005:l036","ordinal":169054,"en":"He will unleash utter turmoil."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b005:l037","ordinal":169055,"en":"Let us go to the accursed man;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b005:l038","ordinal":169056,"en":"Saying, ‘My horse is thin,’"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1217:b005:l039","ordinal":169057,"en":"Let us lodge our complaint."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b003:l001","ordinal":169058,"en":"To the open-hearted bloodthirsty man,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b003:l002","ordinal":169059,"en":"Saying, ‘My horse is feeble,’"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b003:l003","ordinal":169060,"en":"Saying, ‘I myself am alone,’"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b003:l004","ordinal":169061,"en":"Let us make a jest of it."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b003:l005","ordinal":169062,"en":"If the bloodthirsty man can be reasoned with,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b003:l006","ordinal":169063,"en":"Let us scatter the food and provisions,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b003:l007","ordinal":169064,"en":"Mount our horses,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b003:l008","ordinal":169065,"en":"And flee in every direction."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b003:l009","ordinal":169066,"en":"Why should we test ourselves"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b003:l010","ordinal":169067,"en":"Against the teeming Chinese?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b003:l011","ordinal":169068,"en":"If Khan Manas brings them hell,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b003:l012","ordinal":169069,"en":"Let us wait and then depart.”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b003:l013","ordinal":169070,"en":"With elder Koshoy as their leader,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b003:l014","ordinal":169071,"en":"All the Muslims then"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b003:l015","ordinal":169072,"en":"Voiced their grievance."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b003:l016","ordinal":169073,"en":"“If we fight during the feast,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b003:l017","ordinal":169074,"en":"It will be a disgrace upon us."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b003:l018","ordinal":169075,"en":"This is no time fit for combat,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b003:l019","ordinal":169076,"en":"No hour for waging war.”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b003:l020","ordinal":169077,"en":"They wept before Khan Manas"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b003:l021","ordinal":169078,"en":"And cried out their grievance."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b003:l022","ordinal":169079,"en":"One bloodthirsty man said"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b003:l023","ordinal":169080,"en":"That his horses were thin;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b003:l024","ordinal":169081,"en":"Another said"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b003:l025","ordinal":169082,"en":"That he himself was alone."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b003:l026","ordinal":169083,"en":"Another spoke,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b003:l027","ordinal":169084,"en":"Saying his father was old."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b003:l028","ordinal":169085,"en":"Raging and shouting,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b003:l029","ordinal":169086,"en":"He began the great turmoil."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b003:l030","ordinal":169087,"en":"Khan Manas then"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b003:l031","ordinal":169088,"en":"Slaughtered and left"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b003:l032","ordinal":169089,"en":"All the assembled people."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b003:l033","ordinal":169090,"en":"“Curse your father's graves, wretched people;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b003:l034","ordinal":169091,"en":"Do not say, ‘My horse is thin,’"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b003:l035","ordinal":169092,"en":"And eat shame on account of your horse."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b003:l036","ordinal":169093,"en":"Whoever says, ‘My horse is thin,’"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b003:l037","ordinal":169094,"en":"I shall slaughter and eat his horse now."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b003:l038","ordinal":169095,"en":"Whoever says, ‘I myself am alone,’"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b003:l039","ordinal":169096,"en":"I shall slaughter him now."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b004:l001","ordinal":169097,"en":"Akkula's prize—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b004:l002","ordinal":169098,"en":"How can I fail to take it?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b004:l003","ordinal":169099,"en":"How can I fail to bring"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b004:l004","ordinal":169100,"en":"One slaughter upon China?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b004:l005","ordinal":169101,"en":"His anger rising, he shouted;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b004:l006","ordinal":169102,"en":"Some he confined,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b004:l007","ordinal":169103,"en":"Some he beat,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b004:l008","ordinal":169104,"en":"Some he cursed,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b004:l009","ordinal":169105,"en":"And some he ordered onward."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b004:l010","ordinal":169106,"en":"All the Muslims,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b004:l011","ordinal":169107,"en":"Unable to posture in resentment,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b004:l012","ordinal":169108,"en":"Said, “Is it not Manas"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b004:l013","ordinal":169109,"en":"Who will slaughter every Muslim,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b004:l014","ordinal":169110,"en":"Who will do to us"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b004:l015","ordinal":169111,"en":"Whatever he himself wishes,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b004:l016","ordinal":169112,"en":"Who will somehow reach"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b004:l017","ordinal":169113,"en":"Your very root!”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b004:l018","ordinal":169114,"en":"The great black Muslim people"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b004:l019","ordinal":169115,"en":"Wept and spoke from the heart."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b004:l020","ordinal":169116,"en":"As they stood exactly thus,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b004:l021","ordinal":169117,"en":"Your fortunate lion Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b004:l022","ordinal":169118,"en":"Against the teeming infidel,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b004:l023","ordinal":169119,"en":"Against hero Khan Kongurbai,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b004:l024","ordinal":169120,"en":"Girded the jekene at his waist;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b004:l025","ordinal":169121,"en":"Against the infidels bending the earth,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b004:l026","ordinal":169122,"en":"Manas attacked alone."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b004:l027","ordinal":169123,"en":"Raging, he shouted,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b004:l028","ordinal":169124,"en":"Calling out to Kongurbai:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b004:l029","ordinal":169125,"en":"“Chinese people of forty khans,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b004:l030","ordinal":169126,"en":"You have come from your farthest bounds;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b004:l031","ordinal":169127,"en":"I have given you abundant food."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b004:l032","ordinal":169128,"en":"The host of ninety black infidels—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b004:l033","ordinal":169129,"en":"You came without breaking formation;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b004:l034","ordinal":169130,"en":"The countless slaughter animals,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b004:l035","ordinal":169131,"en":"I gave in a mountain-like heap."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b004:l036","ordinal":169132,"en":"I gave red gold and livestock;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b004:l037","ordinal":169133,"en":"I gave red-tailed camels."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b004:l038","ordinal":169134,"en":"Black Chinese and many Manchus—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1218:b004:l039","ordinal":169135,"en":"Akkula's prize—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l001","ordinal":169136,"en":"Do not take it away; leave it here."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l002","ordinal":169137,"en":"You are no fool capable of taking it,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l003","ordinal":169138,"en":"And I am no Manas who would let it be taken!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l004","ordinal":169139,"en":"Three times I unleashed a great slaughter."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l005","ordinal":169140,"en":"On the plain of Ükürchü,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l006","ordinal":169141,"en":"Along Üch-Kapkak,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l007","ordinal":169142,"en":"I raided and took three of your settlements."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l008","ordinal":169143,"en":"It was not merely your horses, my Kalmyk;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l009","ordinal":169144,"en":"I seized your herds as well."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l010","ordinal":169145,"en":"When I sacked your three cities,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l011","ordinal":169146,"en":"When I raided and took your monks,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l012","ordinal":169147,"en":"I cut off"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l013","ordinal":169148,"en":"Your monks' topknots entirely."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l014","ordinal":169149,"en":"I took a letter written in Chinese;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l015","ordinal":169150,"en":"I gelded your monk and made him a mount."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l016","ordinal":169151,"en":"I brought a ruinous time upon you!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l017","ordinal":169152,"en":"I dug your grave deep;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l018","ordinal":169153,"en":"I hewed your road backward;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l019","ordinal":169154,"en":"I did wonders indeed!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l020","ordinal":169155,"en":"I traced many strange paths for you;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l021","ordinal":169156,"en":"I burned and destroyed five of your cities."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l022","ordinal":169157,"en":"I brought great humiliation upon you;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l023","ordinal":169158,"en":"Five of your daughters with forelocks"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l024","ordinal":169159,"en":"I took as booty."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l025","ordinal":169160,"en":"Have you now become a man?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l026","ordinal":169161,"en":"Have you mounted a horse, looming there?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l027","ordinal":169162,"en":"Yesterday, after traveling seven years on foot,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l028","ordinal":169163,"en":"Above Jet-Kayt,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l029","ordinal":169164,"en":"I destroyed seven of your cities at once."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l030","ordinal":169165,"en":"I plundered much of your treasure;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l031","ordinal":169166,"en":"I stirred up much destructive turmoil."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l032","ordinal":169167,"en":"Eating seven batmans of wheat,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l033","ordinal":169168,"en":"You reek of grain, Joloy;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l034","ordinal":169169,"en":"Having killed seventy giants,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l035","ordinal":169170,"en":"You reek of blood, Joloy."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l036","ordinal":169171,"en":"Eating sixty batmans of wheat,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l037","ordinal":169172,"en":"You reek of grain, Joloy;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l038","ordinal":169173,"en":"Having killed sixty giants,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l039","ordinal":169174,"en":"You reek of blood, Joloy."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l001","ordinal":169175,"en":"Akkula's prize—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l002","ordinal":169176,"en":"Do not take it away; leave it here!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l003","ordinal":169177,"en":"I am no Manas who will let it be taken;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l004","ordinal":169178,"en":"You are no Joloy who can take it!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l005","ordinal":169179,"en":"Because of this prize,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l006","ordinal":169180,"en":"I shall be steeped in bloody blood."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l007","ordinal":169181,"en":"My sprawling Black Kalmyk,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l008","ordinal":169182,"en":"I shall fight for six months without fleeing."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l009","ordinal":169183,"en":"I shall divide your seven cities;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l010","ordinal":169184,"en":"I shall pursue you to the end and die fighting."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l011","ordinal":169185,"en":"Tell of your red spear and its sheath;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l012","ordinal":169186,"en":"Fucking Chinese, tell the truth!”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l013","ordinal":169187,"en":"With a battle cry, Manas"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l014","ordinal":169188,"en":"Reached Khan Joloy."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l015","ordinal":169189,"en":"He seized his black-bladed whip"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l016","ordinal":169190,"en":"And swung it around;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l017","ordinal":169191,"en":"Charging at Joloy,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l018","ordinal":169192,"en":"He struck him across the jaw."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l019","ordinal":169193,"en":"His black malakay hat"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l020","ordinal":169194,"en":"Flew shrieking into the sky."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l021","ordinal":169195,"en":"When Manas attacked,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l022","ordinal":169196,"en":"Everyone now attacked."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l023","ordinal":169197,"en":"The sovereign old Bakai"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l024","ordinal":169198,"en":"Chased and scattered the infidels,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l025","ordinal":169199,"en":"Who swarmed like black worms."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l026","ordinal":169200,"en":"Poor Joloy ran,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l027","ordinal":169201,"en":"Taking refuge among his Kalmyks,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l028","ordinal":169202,"en":"Blood streaming from his jaw."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l029","ordinal":169203,"en":"A bruise as large as a horse's head rose;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l030","ordinal":169204,"en":"He barely bound his jaw with a scarf."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l031","ordinal":169205,"en":"A bruise as large as a yurt rose;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l032","ordinal":169206,"en":"Groaning, he bound his jaw with a scarf."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l033","ordinal":169207,"en":"The strongest of the jacketed Chinese"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l034","ordinal":169208,"en":"Asked him what had happened:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l035","ordinal":169209,"en":"“Warrior leopard of the Chinese,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l036","ordinal":169210,"en":"What happened to your jaw?” they asked."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l037","ordinal":169211,"en":"“His father Kyrgyz, his mother Sart,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l038","ordinal":169212,"en":"The slave Manas who resembles an Argyn,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l039","ordinal":169213,"en":"Who gnaws frozen apples—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1220:b003:l001","ordinal":169214,"en":"That bastard born of foul urine,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1220:b003:l002","ordinal":169215,"en":"That shrieking Burut—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1220:b003:l003","ordinal":169216,"en":"It seems his way struck me;"}]
